    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "1st Class Properties are delighted to bring to the market No.15 Hawthorn Park, a most impressive four bedroom semi detached corner property presented in very good condition. The property has been very well maintained throughout.\nIdeally located within the sought after Hawthorn Park development. \n\nOnly minutes' walk to Swords Main Street, all amenities are on your doorstep including bus routes, schools, shops, restaurants and the Pavilions Shopping Centre. The spacious accommodation extends to 120 sq.m. and comprises , entrance hall, guest toilet, living room, dining room and kitchen/breakfast room. Upstairs there are four bedrooms, main bedroom with en suite and the family bathroom. \n\nViewing is highly recommended and by appointment only.\n\nHighlights\nBright & spacious accommodation approx 120 sq.m\nMinutes' walk to Swords Main Street and all amenities\nMature, sought after development\nPrivate front garden\nGas Central Heating"
      },
